      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 15 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## R0 / R1\nUsar **Annotations** de Grafana para marcar:\n- Baseline\n- **R0** unprotected + fallo\n- **R1** protected + mismo fallo\n\nHotel (LOCAL):\n- A 503: R0=R1=100% error\n- B MySQL: p95↓ success↓\n- C bulkhead: aislamiento sí, success↓\n\nSports/Cine: paneles OTLP se llenan cuando exporten con `service.name` correcto."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Buscar traza (Tempo) — pegar Trace ID OTel",
      "type": "traces",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 22 },
      "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "queryType": "traceqlSearch",
          "refId": "A",
          "filters": [
            {
              "id": "service-name",
              "tag": "service.name",
              "operator": "=",
              "scope": "resource",
              "value": ["hotel-api", "sports-api", "cine-api"],
              "valueType": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
